   Q('mcq', 'Why did fewer participants take part than the students had hoped?', 'B', "it was exam season, and quite a lot of students who'd signed up didn't turn up", 'Many did not turn up during exams.', opts=['The biscuits ran out.', 'Many volunteers did not attend because of exams.', 'The tutor limited the numbers.']),
